  <!-- EN: Trade Festival -->
  <Kiiro_TradeFestival.root.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>贸易节日</Kiiro_TradeFestival.root.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: The annual Trade Festival has begun! During the festival, Kiiro shops in the colony will sell goods at discounted prices and purchase items at favorable rates. Friendly faction caravans will also visit more frequently.\n\nThe festival will last for [durationDays] days. -->
  <Kiiro_TradeFestival.root.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>一年一度的贸易节日开始了！节日期间，殖民地的绮罗商铺会以折扣的价格售卖商品，并且以优惠的价格收购货物；友好派系的商队访问也会变得频繁。\n\n节日将持续[durationDays]日。</Kiiro_TradeFestival.root.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Trade Festival: {0} -->
  <Kiiro_TradeFestival.root.nodes.TradeFestivalAlert.label.slateRef>贸易节日：{0}</Kiiro_TradeFestival.root.nodes.TradeFestivalAlert.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: The Kiiro merchants in the colony are hosting a Trade Festival. During the festival, trade prices with the shops will be adjusted by {0}, and caravans will visit more frequently.\n\nRemaining time of the festival: {{0}}. -->
  <Kiiro_TradeFestival.root.nodes.TradeFestivalAlert.explanation.slateRef>殖民地的绮罗商户们正在举办贸易节日。节日期间与商铺的交易价格偏移{0}，商队会更频繁地来访。\n\n节日剩余时间：{{0}}</Kiiro_TradeFestival.root.nodes.TradeFestivalAlert.explanation.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Trade Festival end -->
  <Kiiro_TradeFestival.root.nodes.Delay.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>贸易节日结束</Kiiro_TradeFestival.root.nodes.Delay.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: This year's Trade Festival has ended. Trade with the merchants will return to normal prices. -->
  <Kiiro_TradeFestival.root.nodes.Delay.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>今年的贸易节日结束了。在商铺的交易将恢复正常价格。</Kiiro_TradeFestival.root.nodes.Delay.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Trade Festival end -->
  <Kiiro_TradeFestival.root.nodes.factionBecameHostileToPlayer.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>贸易节日结束</Kiiro_TradeFestival.root.nodes.factionBecameHostileToPlayer.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: The Trade Festival has ended due to the relationship with the Kiiro became hostile. -->
  <Kiiro_TradeFestival.root.nodes.factionBecameHostileToPlayer.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>因为与绮罗关系变为敌对，贸易节日结束了。</Kiiro_TradeFestival.root.nodes.factionBecameHostileToPlayer.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  
